\omega_{1}}\cot\left(\frac{\pi z}{2\omega_{1}}\right)" display="inline"><mrow><mrow><mi href="./23.2#E5" title="Weierstrass zeta function">ζ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi href="./23.1#t1.r4" title="complex">z</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi href="./23.2#iii.p2" title="complex number">η</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⁢</mo><mi href="./23.1#t1.r4" title="complex">z</mi></mrow><msub><mi href="./23.1#t1.r8" title="lattice generators">ω</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi href="./3.12#E1" title="the ratio of the circumference of a circle to its diameter">π</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⁢</mo><msub><mi href="./23.1#t1.r8" title="lattice generators">ω</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em">⁢</mo><mrow><mi href="./4.14#E7" title="cotangent function">cot</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi href="./3.12#E1" title="the ratio of the circumference of a circle to its diameter">π</mi><mo>⁢</mo><mi href="./23.1#t1.r4" title="complex">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⁢</mo><msub><mi href="./23.1#t1.r8" title="lattice generators">ω</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math class="ltx_Math" altimg="m2.png" altimg-height="73px" altimg-valign="-28px" altimg-width="283px" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{2\pi}{\omega_{1}}\sum_{n=1}^{\infty}\frac{q^{2n}}{1-q^{2n}%
}\sin\left(\frac{n\pi z}{\omega_{1}}\right)." display="inline"><mrow><mrow><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⁢</mo><mi href="./3.12#E1" title="the ratio of the circumference of a circle to its diameter">π</mi></mrow><msub><mi href="./23.1#t1.r8" title="lattice generators">ω</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo>⁢</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi href="./23.1#t1.r2" title="integer">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi href="./23.1#t1.r12" title="nome">q</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⁢</mo><mi href="./23.1#t1.r2" title="integer">n</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi href="./23.1#t1.r12" title="nome">q</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⁢</mo><mi href="./23.1#t1.r2" title="integer">n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em">⁢</mo><mrow><mi href="./4.14#E1" title="sine function">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi href="./23.1#t1.r2" title="integer">n</mi><mo>⁢</mo><mi href="./3.12#E1" title="the ratio of the circumference of a circle to its diameter">π</mi><mo>⁢</mo><mi href="./23.1#t1.r4" title="complex">z</mi></mrow><msub><mi href="./23.1#t1.r8" title="lattice generators">ω</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></math></td>
