<div id="ii.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p class="ltx_p">When <math class="ltx_Math" altimg="m34.png" altimg-height="21px" altimg-valign="-3px" altimg-width="54px" alttext="z\notin\mathbb{L}" display="inline"><mrow><mi href="./23.1#t1.r4" title="complex">z</mi><mo href="./front/introduction#common.t1.r11" title="not an element of">∉</mo><mi href="./23.1#t1.r1" title="lattice">𝕃</mi></mrow></math>,</p>
